# Architecture Patterns & Design Principles

## System Architecture Overview

**This is a sophisticated full-stack Poetry Slam management system with real-time capabilities, built for medium-scale deployment.**

### Scale Characteristics
- **User Base**: 100-1000 concurrent users
- **Data Volume**: Moderate (participants, rounds, news, city tips)
- **Complexity**: Medium (real-time updates, admin panel, PWA)
- **Performance**: Sub-second response times
- **Deployment**: Single server with PostgreSQL

### Core Technology Stack
- **Frontend**: React 19 + Vite + TailwindCSS + React Router v7
- **Backend**: Express.js + PostgreSQL + Raw SQL (no ORM)
- **Real-time**: Socket.io for WebSocket connections
- **PWA**: Progressive Web App with service workers
- **State Management**: TanStack Query for server state
- **Authentication**: Cookie-based with JWT tokens

